        "words": "setup: Search > New Decision creates a decision (201) and OPENS its face (the DecisionPullout, in Edit); the owner writes Context (the source) and Decision; Done titles it by the first line; the hub holds title, text and source under the face-minted id; after a reload Search reopens it under the new title and the card shows text and source. trigger: the same route refuses a bad status with 400 that NAMES the refusal."
